{"id":"1af83a707331071f","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-cobordism.md","title":"Oriented Smooth Cobordism Data","display":"df-cobordism — Oriented Smooth Cobordism Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cobordism","aliases":["58-df-cobordism"],"display":"df-cobordism — Oriented Smooth Cobordism Data","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","[[58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cobordism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cobordism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cobordism — Oriented Smooth Cobordism Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ec1809e41ec24c81\" href=\"?note=ec1809e41ec24c81\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch11/58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"58-df-homeomorphism.md\">58-df-homeomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,W,\\tau_W,\\mathcal A_W,b,\\mathscr U\\in V\">\\(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,W,\\tau_W,\\mathcal A_W,b,\\mathscr U\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb H^{n+1}=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{n+1}:x_n\\geq0\\}\">\\(\\mathbb H^{n+1}=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{n+1}:x_n\\geq0\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{&lt;n}:\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\pi_{&lt;n}:\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> is the coordinate projection.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> are the predicates from the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrientedCobordismDatum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrientedCobordismDatum}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cobordant}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Cobordant}_n\\)</span>, and the bounded quotient <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_n^{SO}(\\mathscr U)\">\\(\\Omega_n^{SO}(\\mathscr U)\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\partial_{\\mathcal A_W}W\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in W:\\exists\\langle U,O,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_W\\;\n(x\\in U\\land\\phi(x)_n=0)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\partial_{\\mathcal A_W}W\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in W:\\exists\\langle U,O,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_W\\;\n(x\\in U\\land\\phi(x)_n=0)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cobordism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrientedCobordismDatum}_S\n(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,W,\\tau_W,\\mathcal A_W,b,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(W,\\tau_W)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(W,\\tau_W)\n\\land\\bigcup\\{U:\\exists O,\\phi\\;(\\langle U,O,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_W)\\}=W\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\langle U,O,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_W\\;\n\\bigl(U\\in\\tau_W\\land O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^{n+1}}\n\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\n(\\phi,U,\\{A\\cap U:A\\in\\tau_W\\},\nO\\cap\\mathbb H^{n+1},\n\\{B\\cap(O\\cap\\mathbb H^{n+1}):B\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^{n+1}}\\})\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\langle U,O,\\phi\\rangle,\\langle V,Q,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_W\\;\n\\Bigl(U\\cap V\\neq\\varnothing\\to\n(\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap V]\\in C^\\infty\n\\land\\forall x\\in U\\cap V\\;(\\det D(\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})_{\\phi(x)}&gt;0)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(b,(M\\times\\{0\\})\\cup(N\\times\\{1\\}),\\partial_{\\mathcal A_W}W\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}\\bigl(b,(M\\times\\{0\\})\\cup(N\\times\\{1\\}),\\partial_{\\mathcal A_W}W\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\langle U,O,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_M\\;\\forall\\langle V,Q,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_W\\;\n\\Bigl(b[U\\times\\{0\\}]\\cap V\\neq\\varnothing\\to\n\\pi_{&lt;n}\\circ\\psi\\circ b\\circ(\\phi^{-1}\\times\\{0\\})\\in C^\\infty\n\\land\\det D(\\pi_{&lt;n}\\circ\\psi\\circ b\\circ(\\phi^{-1}\\times\\{0\\}))&gt;0\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\langle U,O,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_N\\;\\forall\\langle V,Q,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_W\\;\n\\Bigl(b[U\\times\\{1\\}]\\cap V\\neq\\varnothing\\to\n\\pi_{&lt;n}\\circ\\psi\\circ b\\circ(\\phi^{-1}\\times\\{1\\})\\in C^\\infty\n\\land\\det D(\\pi_{&lt;n}\\circ\\psi\\circ b\\circ(\\phi^{-1}\\times\\{1\\}))&lt;0\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cobordism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrientedCobordismDatum}_S\n(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,W,\\tau_W,\\mathcal A_W,b,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(W,\\tau_W)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(W,\\tau_W)\n\\land\\bigcup\\{U:\\exists O,\\phi\\;(\\langle U,O,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_W)\\}=W\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\langle U,O,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_W\\;\n\\bigl(U\\in\\tau_W\\land O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^{n+1}}\n\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\n(\\phi,U,\\{A\\cap U:A\\in\\tau_W\\},\nO\\cap\\mathbb H^{n+1},\n\\{B\\cap(O\\cap\\mathbb H^{n+1}):B\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^{n+1}}\\})\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\langle U,O,\\phi\\rangle,\\langle V,Q,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_W\\;\n\\Bigl(U\\cap V\\neq\\varnothing\\to\n(\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap V]\\in C^\\infty\n\\land\\forall x\\in U\\cap V\\;(\\det D(\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})_{\\phi(x)}&gt;0)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(b,(M\\times\\{0\\})\\cup(N\\times\\{1\\}),\\partial_{\\mathcal A_W}W\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}\\bigl(b,(M\\times\\{0\\})\\cup(N\\times\\{1\\}),\\partial_{\\mathcal A_W}W\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\langle U,O,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_M\\;\\forall\\langle V,Q,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_W\\;\n\\Bigl(b[U\\times\\{0\\}]\\cap V\\neq\\varnothing\\to\n\\pi_{&lt;n}\\circ\\psi\\circ b\\circ(\\phi^{-1}\\times\\{0\\})\\in C^\\infty\n\\land\\det D(\\pi_{&lt;n}\\circ\\psi\\circ b\\circ(\\phi^{-1}\\times\\{0\\}))&gt;0\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\langle U,O,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_N\\;\\forall\\langle V,Q,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_W\\;\n\\Bigl(b[U\\times\\{1\\}]\\cap V\\neq\\varnothing\\to\n\\pi_{&lt;n}\\circ\\psi\\circ b\\circ(\\phi^{-1}\\times\\{1\\})\\in C^\\infty\n\\land\\det D(\\pi_{&lt;n}\\circ\\psi\\circ b\\circ(\\phi^{-1}\\times\\{1\\}))&lt;0\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cobordism\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cobordant}_n(M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,W,\\tau_W,\\mathcal A_W,b\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{OrientedCobordismDatum}_S\n(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,W,\\tau_W,\\mathcal A_W,b,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cobordism\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cobordant}_n(M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,W,\\tau_W,\\mathcal A_W,b\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{OrientedCobordismDatum}_S\n(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,W,\\tau_W,\\mathcal A_W,b,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cobordism\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\n\\Omega_n^{SO}(\\mathscr U)\\coloneqq\n\\{M\\in\\mathscr U:\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\}/\\mathrm{Cobordant}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cobordism\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\n\\Omega_n^{SO}(\\mathscr U)\\coloneqq\n\\{M\\in\\mathscr U:\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\}/\\mathrm{Cobordant}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The topologies, oriented atlases, compact manifold-with-boundary charts, and boundary identification are explicit. The negative Jacobian sign on the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> component implements the boundary term <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-N\">\\(-N\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The ambient set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr U\">\\(\\mathscr U\\)</span> keeps the quotient set-sized; the unrestricted collection of all coded manifolds would be a proper class.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec1809e41ec24c81","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,W,\\tau_W,\\mathcal A_W,b,\\mathscr U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb H^{n+1}=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{n+1}:x_n\\geq0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_{<n}:\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrientedCobordismDatum}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cobordant}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_n^{SO}(\\mathscr U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial_{\\mathcal A_W}W\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in W:\\exists\\langle U,O,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_W\\;\n(x\\in U\\land\\phi(x)_n=0)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cobordism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrientedCobordismDatum}_S\n(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,W,\\tau_W,\\mathcal A_W,b,n)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,n)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(W,\\tau_W)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(W,\\tau_W)\n\\land\\bigcup\\{U:\\exists O,\\phi\\;(\\langle U,O,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_W)\\}=W\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\langle U,O,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_W\\;\n\\bigl(U\\in\\tau_W\\lan